#. Wardrobe note: tap a released look to put it on
msgid "TAP ONE TO WEAR IT"
msgstr "GİYMEK İÇİN DOKUN"

#. Wardrobe cell: the level whose first clear releases this look, e.g. LV 35; very short
msgid "LV %d"
msgstr "SV %d"

#. Wardrobe cell for Classic: in the wardrobe from the start
msgid "START"
msgstr "BAŞTA"

#. Wardrobe cell for MapWoman: released by finishing the game
msgid "THE END"
msgstr "SON"

#. Rubber stamp: the look MapMan is wearing
msgid "WORN"
msgstr "GİYİLİ"

#. Small tag on the main menu: a look not yet seen in the wardrobe
msgid "NEW"
msgstr "YENİ"

#. Wardrobe: when this look was released
msgid "RELEASED AT LEVEL %d"
msgstr "%d. BÖLÜMDE YAYINLANIR"

#. Wardrobe: Classic's line
msgid "IN THE WARDROBE FROM THE START"
msgstr "BAŞTAN BERİ GARDIROPTA"

#. Wardrobe: MapWoman's line
msgid "RELEASED FOR FINISHING THE GAME"
msgstr "OYUNU BİTİRİNCE YAYINLANIR"

#. Slip on the level-clear sheet: a look was just released
msgid "NEW IN THE WARDROBE"
msgstr "GARDIROBA YENİ EKLENDİ"

#. Button on the level-clear slip: wear the look just released, now
msgid "WEAR IT"
msgstr "GİY"

#. Slip on the last sheet: MapWoman can now be worn; keep MAPWOMAN
msgid "MAPWOMAN JOINS THE WARDROBE"
msgstr "MAPWOMAN GARDIROBA KATILDI"

#. Slip on the last sheet: wearing MapWoman, MapMan is the one waiting at the end; keep MAPMAN
msgid "PLAY AS HER: MAPMAN WAITS FOR YOU AT THE END"
msgstr "ONUNLA OYNA: MAPMAN SENİ SONDA BEKLİYOR"

#. Screen reader name of the main menu's wardrobe row
msgid "Wardrobe, %d of %d released"
msgstr "Gardırop, %d / %d yayınlandı"

#. Screen reader: a look's name, and that MapMan wears it
msgid "%s, worn"
msgstr "%s, giyili"

#. Screen reader: a look not released yet
msgid "Locked, released at level %d"
msgstr "Kilitli, %d. bölümde yayınlanır"

#. Screen reader: MapWoman before the game is finished
msgid "Locked, released for finishing the game"
msgstr "Kilitli, oyunu bitirince yayınlanır"

#. Title screen at launch, under the big MAPMAN title: tap anywhere to go on to the main menu. The phone version of an arcade PRESS START.
msgid "TAP TO START"
msgstr "BAŞLAMAK İÇİN DOKUN"

#. Title screen at launch: small corner note while the intro plays; tapping anywhere skips it to the title
msgid "SKIP"
msgstr "GEÇ"
